Models
------
The application loads inference and embedding models at runtime from the
user's browser. Those models are not redistributed by this repository and
remain subject to their own licenses:

  - Qwen / Qwen3.5 family models (Apache-2.0 or Qwen-specific terms,
    depending on the variant the WebLLM build resolves at runtime)
  - sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (Apache-2.0)

